{
  "task_id": "3d-scan-calc",
  "top_k": 5,
  "requirements": [
    {
      "requirement_id": "req_bdfafd127cd3979fc180",
      "requirement_type": "DOMAIN_ACTION",
      "criticality": "CORE",
      "provenance": {
        "source_file": "tasks/3d-scan-calc/instruction.md",
        "source_type": "instruction",
        "line_start": 1,
        "line_end": 1,
        "exact_text": "You need to calculate the mass of a 3D printed part. The input (`/root/scan_data.stl`) is a binary STL, but the 2-byte \"Attribute Byte Count\" at the end of each triangle record is being used to store the **Material ID** of the object.\n",
        "source_sha256": "9524c1a3f03aebc7be6e009c1d8f9fedd4503592205684d4f6a64dde6ee80d47",
        "extraction_rule": "actionable_paragraph"
      }
    },
    {
      "requirement_id": "req_02e9105160260c41ec6c",
      "requirement_type": "DOMAIN_ACTION",
      "criticality": "SUPPORT",
      "provenance": {
        "source_file": "tasks/3d-scan-calc/instruction.md",
        "source_type": "instruction",
        "line_start": 4,
        "line_end": 4,
        "exact_text": "1. Parse the binary STL and identify the **largest connected component** by filtering out any scanning debris.\n",
        "source_sha256": "9524c1a3f03aebc7be6e009c1d8f9fedd4503592205684d4f6a64dde6ee80d47",
        "extraction_rule": "commonmark_list_item"
      }
    },
    {
      "requirement_id": "req_cd391fd602b937d2fdaa",
      "requirement_type": "DOMAIN_ACTION",
      "criticality": "CORE",
      "provenance": {
        "source_file": "tasks/3d-scan-calc/instruction.md",
        "source_type": "instruction",
        "line_start": 5,
        "line_end": 5,
        "exact_text": "2. Extract the Material ID and reference it with `/root/material_density_table.md` to find the corresponding density.\n",
        "source_sha256": "9524c1a3f03aebc7be6e009c1d8f9fedd4503592205684d4f6a64dde6ee80d47",
        "extraction_rule": "commonmark_list_item"
      }
    },
    {
      "requirement_id": "req_265ea05c7a43d486f003",
      "requirement_type": "OUTPUT_PATH",
      "criticality": "CORE",
      "provenance": {
        "source_file": "tasks/3d-scan-calc/instruction.md",
        "source_type": "instruction",
        "line_start": 6,
        "line_end": 7,
        "exact_text": "3. Calculate the mass based on the formula `Volume * Density` and save the result to `/root/mass_report.json` in the following format:\n\n",
        "source_sha256": "9524c1a3f03aebc7be6e009c1d8f9fedd4503592205684d4f6a64dde6ee80d47",
        "extraction_rule": "commonmark_list_item"
      }
    }
  ],
